        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Vizwalo vya ki'hozya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'muwi'la Mose ati', “Mugati' na V'aizilaeli, u'mulete ku' wanne Aloni, muku'lu'yo, haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya Nadabu, Abihu, Eleazali, na Itamali, ki'gele v'antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lamusumi'le muku'lu'yo Aloni vizwalo visondo ki'gele apandi'ke lu'kumo na wu'soga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'v'awi'le v'afundi v'ose av'o nav'apile loho ya wu'manyi, v'amusumi'le Aloni vizwalo ki'gele asondohiwe ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'vi hu' vizwalo i'vyo v'alasume: kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a, ki'zibao, ijoho, nhanzo ya wu'lembwe, isimangi'la na mukwato gwa mu muki'mbi'li'. Vyeni'vyo vizwalo visondo vilasumwe ku'nguno ya ku'zwala mudu'gu'yo Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, ki'gele v'antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'enav'o v'afundi u'v'awi'le v'atu'mi'le zahabu, wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo, na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hangi' v'av'ezye ki'zibao ku' wu'zi wa zahabu na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na ku'fuumwa ku' wu'tonto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'zibao cheni'cho ki'lav'e na mikwato iv'i'li' zya ku'tungi'la mu mav'ega, ki'la iv'ega mukwato gu'mo u'go gu'sumi'lilwe ku' nsoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwato gwa ki'zibao gwa wu'lembwe gwa ku'tunga mu muki'mbi'li' gu'lav'eziwe ku' vilwani'lo vyene vivyo, ku' wu'zi wa zahabu, na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, gu'lasumi'li'lwe gu'v'e ki'ntu' ki'mo na ki'zibao cheni'cho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hangi' u'lasole mawe av'i'li' ga mupango ga shohamu, na ha igu'lya yago u'latone mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Izilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'latone mina mukaga ku' iwe lya kwandya, na mina mukaga gangi' ku' iwe lya wu'v'i'li'. Mina genago gize gahelwe ku'londana na ku'v'yalwa kwav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lagatone mina genago ga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli ha igu'lya na mawe genago av'i'li', ki'ti' i'vyo musuli i'vyo ali'gu'tonaga muhuli. Hangi' u'lagatu'u'le mu vyokazyo vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mawe genago ago gali' mu vyokazyo u'lagatunge ha igu'lya na mikwato zya mu mav'ega ga i'cho ki'zibao, ki'gele gav'e mwizu' ku' V'aizilaeli. Nawe Aloni alagazwale mina genago ku' mav'ega gakwe ha mbele yanne ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'ti' mwizu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye vyokazyo vyeni'vyo viv'i'li' vya zahabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na mikufu iv'i'li' zya zahabu nsoso i'zyo zipelegilwe ki'ti' lu'goye, na u'zitunge mikufu zyeni'zyo ku' vyokazyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lav'ezye kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ku'nguno ya ku'koov'ela wu'yangu' wa v'antu' ku'mwa Mulungu. Kav'eziwe ku' wu'tonto ku' wu'zi wa zahabu, na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, ki'ti' i'cho ki'zibao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalav'e ka mugelani'lo ako kalagondwe kav'e na wu'lihu na wu'gali'nhu wako sentimita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamufuko kenako kalalembwe ku' mihelo ine zya mawe ga mupango. Muhelo gwa kwandya gu'v'e na mawe ga akiki, topazi na bahalamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhelo gwa wu'v'i'li' gu'v'e na mawe ga zumalidi, yakuti na alimasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhelo gwa wu'datu' gu'v'e na mawe ga yasinto, ageti na ametisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhelo gwa wu'ne gu'v'e na mawe ga kilisolito, shohamu na yasipi. Gose gatu'u'lwe mu vyokazyo vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene ku'lav'e na mawe iku'mi na av'i'li', ago gatonilwe mina iku'mi na av'i'li' ga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli. Ki'la li'mo li'tonwe ki'ti' muhuli ki'gele li'v'e na lina li'mo mugati' na mina ga magongo ago iku'mi na av'i'li'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lav'ezye mikufu zya zahabu nsoso i'zyo zipelegilwe ki'ti' lu'goye, ku'nguno ya kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyene vivyo u'lav'ezye pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu ku'nguno ya kamufuko, na ku'zitungi'la ku' mapembo av'i'li' ga ku' igu'lya na kamufuko kenako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lazitunge nsoto iv'i'li' zya mikufu ku' pete zyeni'zyo i'zyo zili' ku' mapembo ga kamufuko kenako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' na i'zyo nsoto zingi' zya mikufu u'lazitunge ku' i'vyo vyokazyo viv'i'li' vya mawe. Vyene vivyo u'lazitungani'zye ku' mikwato zya mu mav'ega ga i'cho ki'zibao ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na ku'zitu'u'la mu mapembo av'i'li' ga ha nsi'li'li' na kamufuko ku' nnuma yako bi'hi' na ki'zibao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye pete zingi' iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na u'zidimani'zye ha lwandi' lwa ha nsi'li'li' ya mikwato zya mav'ega, ha lwandi' lwa ku' mbele lwa cheni'cho ki'zibao, bi'hi' na ipi'ndo ha igu'lya hadoo na mukwato gwa mu muki'mbi'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.27",
